 "library": {
  "title": "Raspberry Pi 5 case lid, 90.5x62 mm, 30 mm fan grille",
  "description": "Rounded lid for the 'Raspberry Pi 5 case base, 90.5x62x26 mm'. It is a 3 mm plate at z 26-29 with 4 mm corner radii and a 1.5 mm fillet on the top edges. A 1.2 mm locating lip, 3 mm deep with 0.25 mm clearance, friction-fits inside the base. It has a 30 mm hex fan grille over the SoC at (28, 29.5), a 52x7 mm GPIO slot, a camera ribbon slot and vent slots over the RP1/USB area. Print it upside down.",
  "tags": [
   "raspberry pi 5",
   "rpi5",
   "lid",
   "case",
   "fan grille",
   "rounded"
  ],
  "source": "assistant",
